<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Smithkline Beecham.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Smithkline Beecham.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued one million American-style call warrants on Smithkline Beecham ordinary shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    8.50 STG		  ISSUE PRICE  1.01 STG</p>
<p> PREMIUM	   17.4 PCT(BREAK EVEN) GEARING	8.0 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	01.JUN.98		 PAYDATE	10.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  8.10 STG</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
